WEBVTT

1
00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:16.418
(FAMILY GRUMBLING)

2
00:02:22.184 --> 00:02:24.390
Where are my golf balls?

3
00:02:27.731 --> 00:02:29.142
Anyone seen my sun block?

4
00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:32.936
What's the point of going to Florida
if you use sun block?

5
00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:35.905
I don't care, I'm getting toasted.

6
00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:39.940
Great. Now you can be a skag
with a darker shade of skin.

7
00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:44.537
He's jealous because he can't tan.
His freckles just connect.

8
00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:48.740
Hey, hey, easy on the fluids!
The rubber sheets are packed.

9
00:02:48.961 --> 00:02:50.289
She wants "Ding."

10
00:02:50.546 --> 00:02:53.001
HOST:
Behind "Ding" is 200 points!

11
00:02:53.215 --> 00:02:54.330
All right!

12
00:02:55.217 --> 00:02:57.210
That gives you 4700 points.

13
00:02:57.469 --> 00:02:59.545
HOST ON RECORDER:
200 points! All right!

14
00:03:02.724 --> 00:03:04.551
Honey, are you packed yet?

15
00:03:04.768 --> 00:03:06.143
Yes.

16
00:03:06.395 --> 00:03:07.675
Yes.

17
00:03:09.648 --> 00:03:10.976
Everything I put out?

18
00:03:12.234 --> 00:03:13.432
Yes.

19
00:03:14.152 --> 00:03:15.397
Yes.

20
00:03:15.821 --> 00:03:18.110
Oh, did you see what Grandma sent you?

21
00:03:18.615 --> 00:03:21.237
Let me guess. Donald Duck slippers?

22
00:03:22.244 --> 00:03:23.193
Close.

23
00:03:23.954 --> 00:03:26.362
Inflatable clown to play with
in the pool.

24
00:03:26.582 --> 00:03:27.661
How exciting.

25
00:03:29.251 --> 00:03:32.454
Why Florida? There's no
Christmas trees in Florida.

26
00:03:32.671 --> 00:03:34.580
What is it with Christmas trees?

27
00:03:34.798 --> 00:03:37.752
How can you have Christmas
without a Christmas tree?

28
00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:41.669
We'll find a nice fake silver one.
Or decorate a palm tree.

29
00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:50.220
ANNOUNCER: Guests of Ding, Dang, Dong
stay at the world-renowned Plaza Hotel:

30
00:03:50.439 --> 00:03:52.977
New York's most exciting
hotel experience.

31
00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:56.851
For reservations, call toll-free,
1- 800-759...

32
00:03:57.779 --> 00:04:02.323
- Where's the camcorder battery?
- I put it in the charger.

33
00:04:14.671 --> 00:04:15.667
How's this?

34
00:04:15.881 --> 00:04:17.340
Oh, much better.

35
00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:21.549
Kevin, put your tie on. We'll be
late for the Christmas pageant.

36
00:04:21.803 --> 00:04:25.967
It's in the bathroom. I can't go in.
Uncle Frank's taking a shower.

37
00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:30.975
He says if I walk in there and see him
naked, I'd never feel like a real man.

38
00:04:32.439 --> 00:04:33.602
Whatever that means.

39
00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:40.059
I'm sure he was kidding.
Just run in and get your tie...

40
00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.487
get out, and don't look
at anything.

41
00:04:44.535 --> 00:04:46.029
FRANK SINGS WITH RADIO:
Well

42
00:04:46.286 --> 00:04:50.948
This cat they're talking about
I wonder who, could it be

43
00:04:51.208 --> 00:04:54.078
'Cause I know I'm the heaviest cat

44
00:04:54.336 --> 00:04:57.420
The heaviest cat you ever did see

45
00:04:57.673 --> 00:05:00.342
When they see me
Walkin ' down the street

46
00:05:00.551 --> 00:05:03.338
None of the fellas want to speak
Hey, hey, hey

47
00:05:03.595 --> 00:05:06.680
On their faces they wear a silly smirk
'Cause they know

48
00:05:06.932 --> 00:05:10.633
I'm the king Of the cool jerks

49
00:05:13.438 --> 00:05:16.807
Get out of here, you pervert,
or I'll slap you silly!

50
00:05:19.486 --> 00:05:22.487
Oh, you're cooking, Frankie.

51
00:05:30.455 --> 00:05:33.492
CHOIR: Christmas tree
My Christmas tree

52
00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:37.333
Lit up like a star

53
00:05:37.588 --> 00:05:40.672
When I see My Christmas tree

54
00:05:40.924 --> 00:05:44.625
Can loved ones be far

55
00:05:44.887 --> 00:05:47.757
Christmas tree I'm certain

56
00:05:48.265 --> 00:05:51.301
Wherever I roam

57
00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:54.515
Kevin's solo's coming up.
Tell Leslie.

58
00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:57.055
Kevin's solo's coming up.
Tell Frank.

59
00:05:57.316 --> 00:05:59.355
Okay. Frank.

60
00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:01.068
Frank!

61
00:06:05.866 --> 00:06:09.033
Christmastime means laughter

62
00:06:09.286 --> 00:06:12.489
Toboggans in the snow

63
00:06:13.123 --> 00:06:15.875
Caroling together

64
00:06:16.126 --> 00:06:19.661
With faces aglow

65
00:06:20.214 --> 00:06:23.168
Stockings on the mantel

66
00:06:23.592 --> 00:06:26.628
A wreath on the door

67
00:06:27.095 --> 00:06:30.429
And my merriest Christmas

68
00:06:30.682 --> 00:06:34.217
Needs just one thing more

69
00:06:34.603 --> 00:06:35.718
GIRL:
Christmas tree

70
00:06:35.979 --> 00:06:38.305
My Christmas tree

71
00:06:40.067 --> 00:06:41.347
(SCREAMING)

72
00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.239
(SHOUTS)

73
00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:55.825
Kevin!

74
00:07:03.006 --> 00:07:05.841
Ladies and gentlemen of the jury...

75
00:07:11.557 --> 00:07:14.593
I'd like to apologize
for whatever displeasure...

76
00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:16.886
I might have caused you.
- What?

77
00:07:17.521 --> 00:07:20.391
My prank was immature and ill-timed.

78
00:07:20.607 --> 00:07:23.976
Immature or not, it was
pretty darn hilarious.

79
00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.272
I also apologize to my brother.

80
00:07:29.908 --> 00:07:31.284
Kevin.

81
00:07:31.535 --> 00:07:32.448
I'm sorry.

82
00:07:34.288 --> 00:07:35.698
KATE:
Oh, Buzz...

83
00:07:36.164 --> 00:07:37.409
that was very nice.

84
00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:39.410
(CLAPPING)

85
00:07:42.546 --> 00:07:45.215
Kevin, do you have something to say?

86
00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:04.893
Beat that, you trout-sniffer.

87
00:08:10.365 --> 00:08:13.319
I'm not sorry. I did it
because Buzz humiliated me.

88
00:08:13.535 --> 00:08:16.109
He gets away with everything,
so I got him.

89
00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:18.488
Since you stupidly
believe his lies...

90
00:08:18.916 --> 00:08:21.667
I don't care if your
Florida trip is wrecked.

91
00:08:21.877 --> 00:08:24.913
Who wants to spend Christmas
in a tropical climate?

92
00:08:25.923 --> 00:08:26.871
