Kevin!

93
00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:29.379
You walk out,
you sleep on the 3rd floor.

94
00:08:29.593 --> 00:08:31.336
Yeah, with me.

95
00:08:32.054 --> 00:08:33.762
So, what else is new?

96
00:08:33.972 --> 00:08:37.637
Don't wreck my trip.
Your dad's paying good money for it.

97
00:08:37.851 --> 00:08:41.101
Wouldn't want to spoil your fun,
Mr. Cheapskate.

98
00:08:46.151 --> 00:08:48.440
What a troubled young man.

99
00:08:52.699 --> 00:08:55.321
They're all a bunch of jerks.

100
00:08:56.453 --> 00:08:57.828
Hi.

101
00:08:59.873 --> 00:09:04.416
Last time we tried to take a trip,
we had a problem just like this.

102
00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.627
Yeah, with me getting crapped on.

103
00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:11.092
I don't care for your choice of words.
That's not what happened.

104
00:09:11.343 --> 00:09:13.466
Buzz apologized to you.

105
00:09:13.679 --> 00:09:16.004
Yeah, then he called me
a trout-sniffer.

106
00:09:16.265 --> 00:09:19.052
He didn't mean it.
He was just sucking up to you.

107
00:09:19.518 --> 00:09:23.385
Okay, why don't you just sit up here
and think things over?

108
00:09:23.647 --> 00:09:27.265
When you're ready to apologize
to everyone, you can come down.

109
00:09:27.484 --> 00:09:30.983
I'm not apologizing to Buzz.
I'd rather kiss a toilet seat!

110
00:09:31.697 --> 00:09:33.773
Then stay up here all night.

111
00:09:33.991 --> 00:09:38.071
I don't want to go down anyway!
I can't trust anybody in this family.

112
00:09:38.287 --> 00:09:42.035
You know what? If I had my own
money, I'd go on my own vacation.

113
00:09:42.249 --> 00:09:46.875
Alone, without any of you. And I'd
have the most fun of my whole life.

114
00:09:47.546 --> 00:09:50.463
You got your wish last year.
Maybe you will this year.

115
00:09:50.674 --> 00:09:52.049
I hope so.

116
00:10:33.217 --> 00:10:35.090
(STATUE CLANKS)

117
00:10:37.679 --> 00:10:40.005
(DOORBELL RINGS)

118
00:10:41.016 --> 00:10:42.925
