- We did it again!

119
00:10:43.644 --> 00:10:44.924
(SCREAMING)

120
00:10:45.521 --> 00:10:47.643
(CLAMORING)

121
00:10:53.654 --> 00:10:56.275
Our McCallisters here,
other McCallisters there.

122
00:10:56.532 --> 00:11:00.481
I shouldn't complain, but
you give the worst wake-up calls.

123
00:11:00.744 --> 00:11:04.279
- Do you have the tickets?
- I've got them. Here's your family's.

124
00:11:04.498 --> 00:11:06.325
- How many do you have?
- Seven.

125
00:11:06.583 --> 00:11:08.576
- We have seven.
- 14!

126
00:11:12.381 --> 00:11:13.579
Seven...

127
00:11:13.841 --> 00:11:14.671
eight...

128
00:11:14.925 --> 00:11:18.294
nine, ten.
- How come we're not sitting together?

129
00:11:18.554 --> 00:11:22.634
This time of year, we're lucky to get
on the same plane. 11, 12, 13.

130
00:11:25.727 --> 00:11:26.759
Where's Kevin?

131
00:11:28.063 --> 00:11:29.438
14.

132
00:11:29.648 --> 00:11:33.776
Good thing I have my own ticket,
just in case you try to ditch me.

133
00:11:44.538 --> 00:11:46.162
- Come on.
- I need batteries.

134
00:11:46.415 --> 00:11:48.657
I'll give them to you on the plane.

135
00:11:48.917 --> 00:11:51.124
- Here's two more.
- Why not now?

136
00:11:51.378 --> 00:11:54.462
Not now! What's the gate number?

137
00:11:54.882 --> 00:11:55.712
H-17.

138
00:11:57.009 --> 00:12:00.508
MAN: Better hurry, it's the last gate.
BUZZ: Dad, what gate is it?

139
00:12:00.721 --> 00:12:02.678
H-17, Buzz. Come on, Kevin.

140
00:12:03.307 --> 00:12:05.714
Kevin, you gonna take my bag?
Take my bag.

141
00:12:05.976 --> 00:12:07.803
Come on. Come on.

142
00:12:34.505 --> 00:12:37.209
ANNOUNCER: American Airlines
flight 226 to New York...

143
00:12:37.466 --> 00:12:40.135
