LESLIE:
We made it.

153
00:13:22.594 --> 00:13:24.920
Everybody here? We made it?
All right.

154
00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:27.340
Please board, the plane's leaving.

155
00:13:27.558 --> 00:13:30.843
- I'll make sure everyone gets on.
- We'll get everyone on.

156
00:13:31.728 --> 00:13:33.804
WOMAN:
Merry Christmas. Have a nice flight.

157
00:13:34.022 --> 00:13:35.600
MEGAN: Bye.
- Bye-bye.

158
