Hey, wait up!

159
00:13:40.195 --> 00:13:41.855
Hey, guys, wait for me!

160
00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:45.567
- Cutting it kind of close.
- Yes.

161
00:13:45.784 --> 00:13:47.864
WOMAN: Merry Christmas.
MAN IN COAT: Merry Christmas.

162
00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:48.700
Wait!

163
00:13:50.372 --> 00:13:51.652
Wait!

164
00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.166
- I'm sorry.
- That's okay. Are you on this flight?

165
00:13:56.420 --> 00:14:00.003
Yeah. My family's on the plane.
I don't want to be left here.

166
00:14:00.257 --> 00:14:02.748
- Do you have a boarding pass?
- Somewhere...

167
00:14:02.968 --> 00:14:04.379
They're ready to go.

168
00:14:04.595 --> 00:14:05.674
He dropped his pass.

169
00:14:05.929 --> 00:14:09.464
This happened to me last year
and almost wrecked my Christmas.

170
00:14:09.683 --> 00:14:11.391
You sure your family's onboard?

171
00:14:11.602 --> 00:14:14.721
My dad ran in right before
I bumped into this lady.

172
00:14:15.522 --> 00:14:19.390
Board him. Make sure he locates
his family before you leave him.

173
00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:21.068
Okay. Come on.

174
00:14:24.573 --> 00:14:25.901
Do you see your family?

175
00:14:26.867 --> 00:14:27.898
There's my dad.

176
00:14:28.202 --> 00:14:31.701
- Find an empty seat. Merry Christmas.
- You too.

177
00:14:31.914 --> 00:14:34.120
In order to push back from the gate...

178
00:14:34.374 --> 00:14:37.541
all passengers must have
their seat belts fastened.

179
00:15:06.073 --> 00:15:08.824
So have you ever been to Florida?

180
00:15:09.034 --> 00:15:12.118
(SPEAKS IN FRENCH)

181
00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:33.015
