I have that feeling.

187
00:15:59.751 --> 00:16:01.578
We forgot something?

188
00:16:02.504 --> 00:16:06.336
No, I don't think we did,
but I just have that feeling.

189
00:16:06.675 --> 00:16:07.920
Just bad memories.

190
00:16:08.468 --> 00:16:12.846
We did everything, brought everything.
We have everybody.

191
00:16:13.056 --> 00:16:14.716
